  "Description": {
    "Cost": 55886084,
    "UIName": "Stalker IV",
    "Id": "chassisdef_stalker_iv_STK-11F",
    "Name": "Stalker IV",
    "Details": "RISC often used the Stalker IV as a test platform for their latests weapons creations, and the -11F is such a test turned into a prototype variant. A Hyper Assault Gauss and a Heavy Rotary Autocannon 5 can deal surprising amounts of damage, and a 275 XL engine frees enough weight to mount them.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.43</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
